aren</h3></div><div class="framer-x11eb5" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><div class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-b9gu54" data-styles-preset="Sk3za0e46" dir="auto">Director CSG Investment Solutions, ING Bank N.V.</div></div></div><div class="framer-aqlrdf" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-7941521b-5ba0-49a3-8b3a-62f47b00c51f, rgb(55, 65, 81));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1fbu26o" data-styles-preset="ynidy4qtS" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-7941521b-5ba0-49a3-8b3a-62f47b00c51f, rgb(55, 65, 81)))">For over 15 years, VI Company has been a trusted partner for the platforms related to ING's exchange traded products. Their team is business minded and comes up with innovative solutions that helps us to give our clients the best possible experience.  </p></div></div><div class="framer-ja9mqd-container" data-framer-name="quote alt left" name="quote alt left"><div aria-hidden="true" style="display:flex;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;width:100%"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="var(--token-220459f7-fb7c-41f5-9a64-8754b262aedb, rgb(212, 212, 216))" d="M6.5 10c-.223 0-.437.034-.65.065.069-.232.14-.468.254-.68.114-.308.292-.575.469-.844.148-.291.409-.488.601-.737.201-.242.475-.403.692-.604.213-.21.492-.315.714-.463.232-.133.434-.28.65-.35l.539-.222.474-.197-.485-1.938-.597.144c-.191.048-.424.104-.689.171-.271.05-.56.187-.882.312-.318.142-.686.238-1.028.466-.344.218-.741.4-1.091.692-.339.301-.748.562-1.05.945-.33.358-.656.734-.909 1.162-.293.408-.492.856-.702 1.299-.19.443-.343.896-.468 1.336-.237.882-.343 1.72-.384 2.437-.034.718-.014 1.315.028 1